msgid "随机占位（Random Occupancy）"
msgstr "Random Occupancy"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:5
#: b5b4fdaf39234fd5a1a187d40a15e639
msgid "**分类：** 合金与组分"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:7
#: 79e4fc20c2dc491bb867b6d64023eea6
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:9
#: 698669e66bd44d9a9b18a5695182a9fa
msgid ""
"在给定总成分约束下，将目标配比真正落到原子占位上。读取 `Comp(...)` 标签或手工"
"输入的成分字符串，用精确或随机模式把各元素分配到离散晶格位点，输出带 "
"`Occ(...)` 标签的真实化学占位结构。"
msgstr ""
"Realize a target composition as discrete atomic occupations. The card reads "
"a `Comp(...)` label or a manual composition, assigns species to lattice "
"sites in Exact or Random mode, and outputs actual chemical configurations "
"labeled `Occ(...)`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:11
#: 7bf39e6af7054590b2dccaae42bd0b62
msgid ""
"典型用法：接在 `Composition Space Sampling` 之后，把目标配比计划转化为可以跑 "
"DFT/NEP 的实际结构。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:13
#: 978154ed271649a8b810aef8e3816fe1
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:15
#: 6b14d614088844579f574aeb4feb2572
msgid "设可占位点数为 $N$，归一化目标比例为 $p_e$。`精确`模式使用最大余数法："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:17
#: 02c1f6f470934c02af32bde57d6fd7da
msgid ""
"\n"
"n_e^{(0)}=\\lfloor Np_e\\rfloor,\\qquad\n"
"\\sum_e n_e=N,\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:22
#: fc8f0ce3065246558870e04c321d2842
msgid ""
"不足的位点按 $Np_e-n_e^{(0)}$ 从大到小补齐，然后把含 $n_e$ 个元素 $e$ 的占位"
"池 随机打乱。`随机`模式则一次性从多项分布 $\\mathbf "
"n\\sim\\operatorname{Multinomial}(N,\\mathbf p)$ 抽取计数，再打乱占位池。 因"
"此精确模式每个样本的元素计数相同；随机模式只在大量样本的统计平均上接近目标比"
"例。 `分组筛选`会把 $N$ 限制为命中 group 标签的位点数。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:28
#: 060638197336452c82b0c69e541848da
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:30
#: e0c9866138124d8783c59f8deecd14c2
msgid "场景：同成分不同排布下的能量预测，模型偏差从 5 跳到 50 meV/atom"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: Error jumps from 5 to 50 meV/atom between arrangements at one "
"composition"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:32
#: 100628a12a434542a98a17b90a377670
msgid ""
"你在 CoCrNi 训练集上跑了 `Composition Space Sampling`，覆盖了从纯元素到等摩尔"
"的各种配比。但每个配比只生成了一个占位结构——对 Co0.33Cr0.33Ni0.33，训练集里 "
"Cr 永远在角落、Co 永远在面心。模型学到的不是\"这个成分\"，而是\"这个成分 + 这"
"个特定排布\"。拿到另一个同样成分但 Cr/Co 位置互换的结构，能量预测偏差从 5 "
"meV/atom 跳到了 50 meV/atom。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:34
#: 587476d12f094fe886f2a08bb66eae24
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 对给定成分，短程化学有序度——哪种原子偏好和哪种原子做邻居——显著"
"影响总能量和局域力。训练集里每种成分只有一个排布样本，模型就把成分和特定排布"
"绑死了。解决：给每个目标配比生成多个不同占位版本。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** Short-range chemical order at fixed composition strongly "
"affects energy and forces. Generate several occupation variants for each "
"target fraction so the model does not conflate composition with one "
"arrangement."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:36
#: 349269e6286a4927a3f6eac29205a18c
msgid ""
"**输入：** 一批带 `Comp(Co=0.3333,Cr=0.3333,Ni=0.3333)` 标签的结构（来自上游 "
"`Composition Space Sampling`）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:38
#: 7ba5b9099ed0449a88b811593ab0bce9
msgid "**目标：** 每个目标配比生成 5 个不同原子排布版本，覆盖排布多样性"
msgstr ""
"**Objective:** Generate five distinct occupations per target composition."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:40
#: 304f83b47ea244b0bf65fe5103b8feb6
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:41
#: 3c79b2768a654b08b242f48aea7b22bf
msgid "`来源`（`source`） = `Auto (Comp tag)` （自动读取上游 Comp 标签）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:42
#: 678306603ea14b749babfca940284b26
msgid ""
"`模式`（`mode`） = `Exact` （精确匹配目标配比，每次排布不同但元素计数一致）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:43
#: bd6da7d158dc48f0a91a6b6e743f7c9f
msgid "`样本数`（`samples`） = `5`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:45
#: 0144ee84dfab4120801bcb1e19ffa46d
msgid ""
"**输出：** 每个输入结构产生 5 个带 `Occ(E)` 标签的结构，元素组成与 Comp 标签"
"一致但原子排布各不相同"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** Five `Occ(E)` structures per input, with species counts matching "
"`Comp` and distinct arrangements."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:47
#: 567731e9a2e1423780645313882525dc
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:48
#: 3839e100ad7b4efc89aa6d195030f59d
msgid ""
"重训后对同一成分的不同排布跑推理，能量方差应该合理——不应全坍缩到一个值，也不"
"应异常发散"
msgstr ""
"After labeling and retraining, predictions across arrangements at one "
"composition should reflect physical differences without anomalous divergence."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:49
#: b7410f856dee460b8f81e19909954704
msgid ""
"抽查几个占位输出，确认元素计数与目标配比一致（Exact 模式）或统计上接近"
"（Random 模式）"
msgstr ""
"Check several outputs: Exact counts should match the target integer "
"allocation, while Random counts should approach it statistically."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:50
#: f3dcd4fb668841f4a26513b5da36cd7e
msgid ""
"如果不同排布之间的能量差异非常小且体系对排布不敏感，可以减少 `样本数`"
"（`samples`）；差异大则增大"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:51
#: de2ab5dc539049078e5d9191575d48cf
msgid ""
"如果上游没有 `Comp(...)` 标签导致输出=输入，切换到手工模式并填写 `手动`"
"（`manual`）成分字符串"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:53
#: 72d9dd2ca21e496e8db225d44c739bd6
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:55
#: 55f8ee7dd33440eb8fe2c550b28bc137
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:56
#: 7b5a8012170849d29392fe307c1b6338
msgid ""
"上游有 `Composition Space Sampling` 或手工定义了目标配比，需要落到具体原子占"
"位"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:57
#: e095d4bc3d2c4552ad59c0c0b13c2b71
msgid "同一成分下需要多个不同原子排布来覆盖短程化学有序度"
msgstr ""
"Several arrangements at one composition are needed to cover short-range "
"chemical order"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:58
#: 3caf75d152aa4442957f6dee9aa160ed
msgid "高熵合金、固溶体等需要成分-排布联合采样的体系"
msgstr ""
"A high-entropy alloy or solid solution requires joint composition-"
"arrangement sampling"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:60
#: 307b5bf307ab4a48aa345670643aca00
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:61
#: 572ab5f6b2224892810c6ff8d45f0cff
msgid "不需要改变原子占位"
msgstr "Atomic occupations should not change"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:62
#: b4264d1515c04e9db1088f002828caa5
msgid "需要直接指定替换规则而非从配比出发 → 用 `Random Doping`"
msgstr "A direct substitution rule is known; use `Random Doping`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:63
#: 78cea078798441d7953ed280751a896b
msgid "输入本身已经是真实的离散占位结构且不再需要多样性"
msgstr ""
"The input already has realized occupations and no additional arrangement "
"diversity is needed"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:65
#: 4a6faf9582554ea8bb410e0eee721f5f
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:67
#: 6d3d5c8db3b042249cf65c10e9749f10
msgid "来源（source）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:69
#: 82bc917b2bd543abafec5602efa3b2b2
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `Auto (Comp tag)`。`Auto` 从输入结构的 `Config_type` 中读取 "
"`Comp(...)` 标签作为目标配比，适合接在 `Composition Space Sampling` 之后。`手"
"动`（`manual`）从下面的 `手动`（`manual`）字段读取手工配比字符串。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:71
#: badd105282aa47c48ab083378a40b791
msgid "手动（manual）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:73
#: 0fa887d4d8ee4373a830cf79f987b635
msgid ""
"`str`，默认空。成分字符串，如 `Co:0.333,Cr:0.333,Ni:0.334`，仅在 "
"`source=Manual` 时生效。比例会被自动归一化。只输入单个元素如 `Ge` 时按 "
"`Ge:1.0` 处理；输入 `Ge,C` 则两个元素默认权重都是 1.0。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, empty by default; Manual only. Composition such as "
"`Co:0.333,Cr:0.333,Ni:0.334`; fractions are normalized. `Ge` means `Ge:1.0`, "
"while `Ge,C` gives both unit weight."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:75
#: f1b425aded4a4a4a88ccdf9b188a3dad
msgid "模式（mode）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:77
#: 95250ccb230c47009611a5d9ac6f04af
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `Exact`。`Exact` 精确匹配目标配比，每个原子的元素分配满足目标计数"
"（向下取整后按余数补足），适合对比实验。`Random` 按目标比例概率采样，整体统计"
"接近但不严格匹配，适合探索性跑样。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `Exact`. `Exact` converts fractions to integer counts by "
"floor-and-remainder allocation, giving fixed composition for comparisons. "
"`Random` samples species probabilities and matches only statistically, which "
"suits exploration."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:79
#: b899311408f046cea859ba21ade1b239
msgid "样本数（samples）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:81
#: a350fa00f9694df5aa705f268ddbf511
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 1。每个输入结构为每个目标配比生成多少个不同占位版本。典型值 "
"1-20。注意总输出 = 上游配比点数 x 这个值，先估算规模再跑。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `1`. Occupation variants per input target, commonly 1-20. "
"Total output equals upstream target count times this value; estimate before "
"running."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:83
#: 6f27adb880884abf99d1e282a21e7aba
msgid "分组筛选（group_filter）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:85
#: fc8ce6659a404d05b7dd07ec4123d7ac
msgid ""
"`str`，默认空。逗号分隔的 group 标签，如 `A,B`。限制只在这些 group 内的位点上"
"做占位分配。填写后，输入必须带 `atoms.arrays['group']` 且至少有一个标签命中；"
"否则卡片会明确报错，不会退化成全结构占位。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:87
#: 9df21e024b6e44119d4c5413a0861c7c
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:89
#: 77e5562c834e4109b7161e12b788ace4
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 false。打开后固定随机路径，`随机种子`（`seed`）不同取值产生不同"
"占位分布。程序会结合输入结构的 stable config ID 为每个样本派生独立种子。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:91
#: 6c6df71b9c544e88ab972f1387f2e85a
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:93
#: 02a409b845354120971f160167aaf3eb
msgid "`int`，默认 0。不同取值产生不同的占位分布。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `0`. Different values generate different occupation "
"distributions."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:95
#: e1544f253b604058bff717ff2c3542d8
