#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:144
#: 4c54157d92534351b8456b7594584f4f
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:146
#: af7eca132af14f04b1b8cb427a39831c
msgid ""
"`Composition Space Sampling` → `Random Occupancy`：标准合金 pipeline，配比 → "
"落位。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:147
#: f38a21c10d3f4ac19ba92ed690db1972
msgid "`Group Label` → `Random Occupancy`：先打 group 标签，再限制占位区域。"
msgstr ""
"`Group Label` -> `Random Occupancy`: label a sublattice before restricting "
"occupation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:148
#: f58e61b788dd4db2ac1ee96957fbb4c8
msgid "`Random Occupancy` → `Atomic Perturb`：占位后加坐标噪声松驰局部应力。"
msgstr ""
"`Random Occupancy` -> `Atomic Perturb`: add coordinate diversity after "
"occupation; use relaxation for physical structures."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:150
#: 5de32cb8346c49248df99eabc87c66f3
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:152
#: ebfacd07ed524248bc9148ebe02cb82c
msgid ""
"**提示缺少目标成分。** 上游没有 `Comp(...)` 标签且 `手动`（`manual`）为空时，"
"卡片会停止并报错。检查 `来源`（`source`）设置，或切换到 Manual 模式并填写成"
"分；它不会再把原结构当成成功输出。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:154
#: 2431b6f55a864c63a2835a7352e3757c
msgid ""
"**占位后元素数量与标签不一致。** `Random` 模式下统计浮动是正常的。换 `Exact` "
"模式可精确匹配。"
msgstr ""
"**Species counts differ from the target.** Random mode fluctuates "
"statistically; use Exact for deterministic integer counts."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:156
#: 7ed08cf31fed45d9a7299f4b3152d892
msgid ""
"**输出数量远超预期。** 输出 = 输入帧数 x `样本数`（`samples`）。上游 500 个配"
"比点 x `samples=5` = 2500 个结构。先估算总规模再跑。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:158
#: f974cfedde634ae5953634ae844edbb5
msgid ""
"**group_filter 报错。** 检查输入结构是否有 `atoms.arrays['group']` 且标签拼写"
"完全匹配。缺少数组和零命中都会报错，避免本来只想改 A 组却意外改完整个结构。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:160
#: 1ffa58dff7aa4f8f869d7097872ccbf3
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:162
#: a4e2ada62098432782ca5b9c02f024d6
msgid ""
"`Occ(E)` / `Occ(R)` / `Occ(E,s=...)` / `Occ(R,s=...)`。E = Exact，R = "
"Random。使用 seed 时附加种子值便于追踪。"
msgstr ""
"`Occ(E)`, `Occ(R)`, `Occ(E,s=...)`, or `Occ(R,s=...)`; E means Exact and R "
"Random. Seeded output includes the seed for traceability."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:164
#: d9ba80b8eff248d8ad8ad1b23752f480
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:166
#: 8622603c89d846da80790281fd8fe038
msgid ""
"勾选 `使用随机种子`（`use_seed`） + 固定 `随机种子`（`seed`）可复现。种子与输"
"入结构的 stable config ID 联合派生样本级种子，相同配置 + 相同 seed → 相同占位"
"序列。注意输入结构顺序变化会影响结果。"
msgstr ""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "典型用法：接在 `Composition Sweep` 之后，把目标配比计划转化为可以跑 DFT/"
#~ "NEP 的实际结构。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The standard use is after `Composition Sweep`, converting composition "
#~ "plans into structures that can be relaxed and labeled by DFT."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "你在 CoCrNi 训练集上跑了 `Composition Sweep`，覆盖了从纯元素到等摩尔的各种"
#~ "配比。但每个配比只生成了一个占位结构——对 Co0.33Cr0.33Ni0.33，训练集里 Cr "
#~ "永远在角落、Co 永远在面心。模型学到的不是\"这个成分\"，而是\"这个成分 + 这"
#~ "个特定排布\"。拿到另一个同样成分但 Cr/Co 位置互换的结构，能量预测偏差从 5 "
#~ "meV/atom 跳到了 50 meV/atom。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "A CoCrNi composition sweep covers pure-to-equiatomic fractions, but each "
#~ "composition has one occupation. At Co0.33Cr0.33Ni0.33, Cr always occupies "
#~ "one site family and Co another. The model binds composition to that "
#~ "arrangement and fails when Co and Cr exchange sites."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输入：** 一批带 `Comp(Co=0.3333,Cr=0.3333,Ni=0.3333)` 标签的结构（来自上"
#~ "游 `Composition Sweep`）"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Input:** Structures labeled `Comp(Co=0.3333,Cr=0.3333,Ni=0.3333)` by "
#~ "`Composition Sweep`."

#~ msgid "`source` = `Auto (Comp tag)` （自动读取上游 Comp 标签）"
#~ msgstr "`source` = `Auto (Comp tag)`"

#~ msgid "`mode` = `Exact` （精确匹配目标配比，每次排布不同但元素计数一致）"
#~ msgstr "`mode` = `Exact` to keep counts fixed while changing arrangements."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "如果不同排布之间的能量差异非常小且体系对排布不敏感，可以减少 `samples`；差"
#~ "异大则增大"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Reduce `samples` when validated arrangement energies are nearly "
#~ "insensitive; increase it when short-range order matters strongly."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "如果上游没有 `Comp(...)` 标签导致输出=输入，切换到手工模式并填写 `manual` "
#~ "成分字符串"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If no upstream `Comp(...)` label exists, switch to Manual and provide the "
#~ "composition explicitly."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "上游有 `Composition Sweep` 或手工定义了目标配比，需要落到具体原子占位"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "A target composition from `Composition Sweep` or manual input must be "
#~ "realized as sites"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `Auto (Comp tag)`。`Auto` 从输入结构的 `Config_type` 中读取 "
#~ "`Comp(...)` 标签作为目标配比，适合接在 `Composition Sweep` 之后。`Manual` "
#~ "从下面的 `manual` 字段读取手工配比字符串。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `Auto (Comp tag)`. `Auto` reads a `Comp(...)` target from "
#~ "`Config_type`, normally after `Composition Sweep`. `Manual` reads the "
#~ "`manual` field."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认空。逗号分隔的 group 标签，如 `A,B`。限制只在这些 group 内的位"
#~ "点上做占位分配。需要输入结构已带 `atoms.arrays['group']`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, empty by default. Comma-separated group labels such as `A,B`; only "
#~ "those sites are reassigned. Input must contain `atoms.arrays['group']`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`bool`，默认 false。打开后固定随机路径，`seed` 不同取值产生不同占位分布。"
#~ "程序会结合输入结构的 stable config ID 为每个样本派生独立种子。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default `false`. Fix the random path. The card combines `seed` "
#~ "with the stable configuration ID to derive per-sample seeds."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`Composition Sweep` → `Random Occupancy`：标准合金 pipeline，配比 → 落位。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Composition Sweep` -> `Random Occupancy`: standard alloy path from "
#~ "fractions to sites."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出 = 输入，没有变化。** 上游没有 `Comp(...)` 标签且 `manual` 为空。检"
#~ "查 `source` 设置，或切换到 Manual 模式并填写成分。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output equals input.** No `Comp(...)` label was found and `manual` is "
#~ "empty. Correct `source` or enter a manual composition."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出数量远超预期。** 输出 = 输入帧数 x `samples`。上游 500 个配比点 x "
#~ "`samples=5` = 2500 个结构。先估算总规模再跑。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output is much larger than expected.** Count is input frames times "
#~ "`samples`; 500 targets with five samples produce 2,500 structures."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**group_filter 不生效。** 检查输入结构是否有 `atoms.arrays['group']` 且标"
#~ "签拼写完全匹配。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**`group_filter` has no effect.** Confirm `atoms.arrays['group']` exists "
#~ "and labels match exactly."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "勾选 `use_seed` + 固定 `seed` 可复现。种子与输入结构的 stable config ID 联"
#~ "合派生样本级种子，相同配置 + 相同 seed → 相同占位序列。注意输入结构顺序变"
#~ "化会影响结果。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Enable `use_seed` and fix `seed` to reproduce occupations. Sample seeds "
#~ "derive from the stable configuration ID and base seed. Input order "
#~ "changes can affect output."
